      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "POST /lessons  {board id}  ->  {lesson id, speech URL, token}\nWS   speech gateway /ws?lesson=..&token=..&from=n\n     in: audio chunks    out: rough text, settled sentences\nLive updates channel (Padlet's own, A)  ->  diagram changes\nPOST /lessons/:id/end  ->  starts the export\nGET  /lessons/:id/export  ->  lesson.json\nJev: POST api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone  {last 3 sentences, 3 questions}",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1709281602,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "POST /lessons  {board id}  ->  {lesson id, speech URL, token}\nWS   speech gateway /ws?lesson=..&token=..&from=n\n     in: audio chunks    out: rough text, settled sentences\nLive updates channel (Padlet's own, A)  ->  diagram changes\nPOST /lessons/:id/end  ->  starts the export\nGET  /lessons/:id/export  ->  lesson.json\nJev: POST api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone  {last 3 sentences, 3 questions}",
