      "text": "- GPU supply: reserve L4s in each region before school terms start\n- A region goes down: move its lessons to the nearest one (EU stays in EU)\n- Backups have limits too: check Deepgram's stream cap, OpenRouter's rate limit\n- ~10k browsers connected at peak: test Padlet's live updates channel\n- Load test: replay 10k fake lessons before back-to-school",
